<title>TAIWAN: Far Eastern 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Far Eastern 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				28,974 vs  34,257</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1,200 vs   2,652</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1,200 vs   2,510</p>
<p>NOTE - Far Eastern Textile Ltd is Taiwan's largest textile maker. The company has attributed its profit plunge to sluggish sales and prices in the polyester fibre industry.</p>
<p>The firm has set a 1997 net profit target of T$2.605 billion on sales of T$30.508 billion.</p>
</text>
